    "title": "Chasing Goodness to Find Strength - NewsBreak",
    "text": "cozadlocal.com\nwebsite\nCozad\nChasing Goodness to Find Strength\nBy TAEH SOE, CORRESPONDENT,\n8 hours agoThis year, 46 swimmers on the Cozad swim team were once again coached by Anne Burkholder and her friend Karen Labrayere. Before moving to Cozad, Burkholder coached kids aged eight and under between her junior and senior years in high school and continued through her senior year and into her freshman year of college. Coach Anne and Coach Karen have coached alongside each other with the Cozad swim team for over 18 years now. “I had a swimming coach growing up who was really instrumental in my life,” stated Burkholder.",
